Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:59:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add WHM Ethernet neighbor TLVs for topology responses

Fix test_emex failures where Ethernet 1905 and non-1905 neighbor
information was missing from Topology Response messages.

Signed-off-by: Aryan Khare <aryakhar@qti.qualcomm.com>
